        <https://doi.org/10.1098/rspb.2012.2670>,
        <https://doi.org/10.1111/j.1469-7580.2011.01386.x> ;
    pk1:hasAssessment <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-code-traceability>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-model-fidelity>,
