<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-bailleul-allometric-cranial-sutures-measurement-strain-coupled-lambdoid-sagittal-sii-ratio-under-heterogeneous-masticatory-strain-pass-3-item-2> a schema:PropertyValue,
        pk1:EvidenceItem ;
    rdfs:label "Strain-coupled lambdoid / sagittal SII ratio under heterogeneous masticatory strain (Pass 3 item 2) = 0.8855 SII_lambdoid / SII_sagittal" ;
    dct:description "Strain-coupled SII: coronal 2.161 (D_f 1.247), sagittal 2.748 (D_f 1.331), lambdoid 2.433 (D_f 1.293); mean ectocranial alpha coronal 0.926, sagittal 1.200, lambdoid 1.267. The reduced model reproduces the mean-alpha ordering lambdoid > sagittal > coronal but NOT the SII ordering (heterogeneous lambdoid profile has flat asterion flanks); this mismatch is reported, not tuned away" ;
    schema:measurementTechnique "Reduced-order Kirchhoff-Love vault strain eps_nn(s, zeta) -> alpha(s, zeta) = alpha_unl + (alpha_sag - alpha_unl) eps_hat, heterogeneous-alpha layered KS/KPZ per suture" ;
